5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I need to know if this budget covers the running costs or just the start.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,We have buried too many projects. I want to see what actually worked before.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,Rosters are where new programs land. I need to see the staffing pressure.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Everything must fit into the existing day. I am worried about capacity.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Things break in year two. I want to see where recent starts failed.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that is a fair point. The hidden costs are the real risk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, exactly. If it did not work before, why start it again?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, capacity is key. If the rooms are full, we cannot add more.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, yes. The booking system is already tight. I am checking that.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the board minutes. They show where the rot starts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the ledger. I need to see the actual allocation.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will look at the readmission figures. Data beats opinion.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will review the therapy and midwifery staffing. It shows the slack.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the rooms and parking coverage. It tells us the limit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the board minutes on the jointly run clinic.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us see what the numbers say.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. The past is the best predictor.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope the staffing is not as bad as I fear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,We need to avoid overloading the system.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,We will see.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
