35,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ledger shows the allocation is down by a quarter. Fitting out is charged to it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The readmission trial worked, but only while it ran. It drifted back after.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Therapy staff are leaving, but midwifery has unusual slack due to falling births.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Outpatient rooms book out by mid-morning. The car park fills before eleven.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The jointly run clinic closed in a year. Neither department would hold the budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that confirms my fear. If they won't hold the budget, it dies.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, yes. The readmission data shows it needs constant funding to work.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, if the rooms are full, a new unit will just add to the queue.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, correct. The booking system only holds named slots. Unnamed work disappears.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,The data agreements took fourteen months to sign. That is a huge delay.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The tariffs are zero for home visits. That is a major cost issue.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,The shared nursing round lost one visit in three to weather and access issues.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,The ward vacancies are nine. Agency cover is rising. The system is strained.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The shuttle only serves four of nineteen villages. Access is a real barrier.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, the home visit data is worrying. The infrastructure is not there.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,We must pick something that fits the current capacity and budget.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,We need a program that has proven results and sustainable staffing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,The midwifery slack is an opportunity. We should use it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,We need to avoid anything that requires new rooms or complex data links.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We must avoid joint management. It fails when responsibilities are unclear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
